<catalogue id="42a3-cb78-b798-d2d1" name="Halo - Banished" revision="1" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="6f3b-423b-f7e2-caee" gameSystemRevision="1" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema"><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="eeb3-2d30-f9ee-75aa" name="Army Setup" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="21cc-23fe-e594-2120"/><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="89da-bc2a-9f9f-3a78"/></constraints><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="49f6-4603-226e-a76a" name="Army Setup" hidden="false" targetId="a02c-b714-98ad-b8e8" primary="true"/></categoryLinks><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="5ba6-3916-df28-76a5" name="Army: Banished" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="a760-e431-0d88-9353"/></constraints><rules><rule id="6b93-e872-8c29-080d" name="Brotherhood of Chaos" hidden="false"><description>Once per turn, when a Banished Infantry unit enters the battlefield from Reserve or Outflanking, it may enter with a Run order and still fire its Small Arms after moving. If it does so, those weapons suffer a -1 to hit penalty, even if they have Assault.</description></rule><rule id="42a5-d225-2783-fe38" name="Trophy Takers" hidden="false"><description>The first time a Banished Brute Infantry unit wins a Close Quarters combat, it gains Trophy Plate Harness for the rest of the battle. The first time any friendly unit that began the battle with Trophy Plate Harness wins a Close Quarters combat, improve its Trophy Plate Harness save to 5+ in Close Quarters for the rest of the battle.

Reminder:
Trophy Plate Harness: Models with Trophy Plate Harness have a 6+ cover save in Close Quarters.</description></rule><rule id="023c-dc4d-2d05-32ac" name="Blood Price" hidden="false"><description>When a friendly Banished Infantry or Artillery unit fails an Order test while within 6&quot; of a friendly Banished Officer or Bloodhandler (including FUBAR), you may choose to remove one model from the unit and then re-roll the Order test. The second result stands as normal. This rule only applies to Infantry or Artillery units of three or more models.</description></rule><rule id="4f93-c732-c181-83ee" name="Atriox's Law" hidden="false"><description>Units with the Berserker special rule can ignore the compulsory Run behavior caused by failing an Order test while they are within the morale bubble of a Banished Officer. The suppression ends immediately if the unit exits the bubble or if the officer is removed from play.</description></rule></rules></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="5585-98c8-0d66-75d8" name="Officer - Platoon commander" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit"><profiles><profile id="30a5-6d93-6d5c-5c68" name="Officer - Platoon commander" hidden="false" typeId="4f99-c622-96b9-db14" typeName="Unit"><modifiers><modifier type="increment" field="c162-476c-a031-003b" value="1"><repeats><repeat value="1" repeats="1" field="selections" scope="5585-98c8-0d66-75d8" childId="d092-8187-de6f-a7cb" shared="true" roundUp="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></repeats></modifier><modifier type="decrement" field="c162-476c-a031-003b" value="1"/><modifier type="set" field="f2ee-ef5c-ac2f-0a29" value="3+"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="5585-98c8-0d66-75d8" childId="db5b-ce0e-a874-5ea6" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></modifier><modifier type="set" field="f2ee-ef5c-ac2f-0a29" value="5+"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="5585-98c8-0d66-75d8" childId="4290-11f5-8034-9e28" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></modifier></modifiers><characteristics><characteristic name="Type" typeId="edb9-a03d-e44e-2632">Infantry</characteristic><characteristic name="Models" typeId="c162-476c-a031-003b">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Damage Value" typeId="f2ee-ef5c-ac2f-0a29">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Transport" typeId="5d1c-b220-d676-62fa">–</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="f879-fc43-44f6-65ab" name="Plasma Pistol/Disruptor (may choose)" hidden="false" typeId="687b-50c6-e68d-9ed8" typeName="Weapon"><modifiers><modifier type="increment" field="1c44-f79c-f5d5-65a2" value="1"><repeats><repeat value="1" repeats="1" field="selections" scope="5585-98c8-0d66-75d8" childId="d092-8187-de6f-a7cb" shared="true" roundUp="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></repeats></modifier><modifier type="decrement" field="1c44-f79c-f5d5-65a2" value="1"/></modifiers><characteristics><characteristic name="Qty" typeId="1c44-f79c-f5d5-65a2">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="88e2-96b8-e9cf-cb86">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="164a-51d2-e474-ab4c">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Pen" typeId="d266-c548-f63b-0ea2">–</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="0bf8-e72d-45f4-c21d">Overcharge, Overheat</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="13a4-e35c-977a-2c18" name="Stalker Rifle (may choose)" hidden="false" typeId="687b-50c6-e68d-9ed8" typeName="Weapon"><modifiers><modifier type="increment" field="1c44-f79c-f5d5-65a2" value="1"><repeats><repeat value="1" repeats="1" field="selections" scope="5585-98c8-0d66-75d8" childId="d092-8187-de6f-a7cb" shared="true" roundUp="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/></repeats></modifier><modifie